  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra situationen f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor med funktionshinder i Estland och Lettland genom utbildninghsprogram i ledarskap, management, IT etc. Projektet f&#xe5;r st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Phare - Lien programmet och Sida delfinansierar med 12 708 Euro.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at improving the situation for people with  disabilities in Estonia and Latvia and includes training programmes inleadership, management, empoverment, IT and peer support. The project has been approved for support within the Phare-Lien Programme and Sidais co-financing with Euro 12 708.</narrative>
